<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.lands`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "land a rite's host half, or set a stale begun half down by hand"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.rite.lands", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.lands"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.rite.lands"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.rite.lands ~ land ~ rite-land, or rite-abandon

`lares rite land --tessera <id>` runs `rite-land` in the vessel that stands after: it rests the host half, naming the begun half; a `--head` or `--image` named must match what the half began at, or it refuses `rite-land-differs`. `land --abandon --tessera <id>` (`rite-abandon`) sets a stale begun half down instead: a hand act that spends nothing, records no par, and frees the face to begin fresh; it names no head or image.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ land · abandon

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`land` params=`tessera/<id> head/<commit> ~ land the host half`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`abandon` params=`abandon/true tessera/<id> ~ set a stale begun half down by hand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ tessera · head · image · abandon · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tessera` params=`takes/id needs/required ~ the begun half's tessera`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit ~ the head; must match the begun half`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`image` params=`takes/digest ~ the image; must match the begun half`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`abandon` params=`~ set the begun half down instead of landing it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ one face, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a landing rides any seat; an abandon reads the hand gate, and a seat refuses hand-act-only`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · rite-begun-absent · rite-land-differs · rite-tree-differs · hand-act-only · hand-unattested

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.rite.lands tessera/<id>]] ~ no tessera, or an abandon naming a head or image`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-begun-absent` params=`~ no begun half stands under the tessera`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-land-differs` params=`~ the head or image differs from the begun half`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-tree-differs` params=`~ the tree differs from the begun half's`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an abandon from an AI seat; a person runs the line`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-unattested` params=`~ nothing attests the branch as a hand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 ~ the host half rests, or the begun half stands abandoned; the answer prints as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares rite land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares rite land]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

